      "end_seconds": 7.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Hi, you know, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.95,
      "end_seconds": 12.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.89,
      "end_seconds": 18.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "I'm here because of bright red blood on the paper."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.61,
      "end_seconds": 26.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.66,
      "end_seconds": 29.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.93,
      "end_seconds": 43.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.99,
      "end_seconds": 54.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.61,
      "text": "It's been one week now. And there's a lump around the back passage as well, five days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.46,
      "end_seconds": 60.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Alright, any black stools or weight loss at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.2,
      "end_seconds": 65.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.31,
      "end_seconds": 71.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Right, have you noticed tummy pain or change in bowel habit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.77,
      "end_seconds": 77.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "No, you know, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.79,
      "end_seconds": 82.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.9,
      "end_seconds": 86.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.76,
      "end_seconds": 91.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.94,
      "end_seconds": 93.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.01,
      "end_seconds": 112.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.38,
      "end_seconds": 117.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Right, my aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.49,
      "end_seconds": 119.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.79,
      "end_seconds": 125.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.71,
      "end_seconds": 129.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.88,
      "end_seconds": 134.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.54,
      "end_seconds": 140.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.99,
      "end_seconds": 156.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.98,
      "end_seconds": 181.12,
      "duration_seconds": 10.14,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 78 beats a minute, respiratory rate 16, BP is 117 over 72. And temp 36.9 degrees, saturation 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.5,
      "end_seconds": 187.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Right, could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.9,
      "end_seconds": 205.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.62,
      "end_seconds": 209.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "stay as you are for a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.87,
      "end_seconds": 236.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.13,
      "text": "There is a soft swelling at the edge of the back passage and a non-tender rectum with no mass."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.44,
      "end_seconds": 240.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.85,
      "end_seconds": 264.68,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, it points towards haemorrhoids. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.61,
      "end_seconds": 267.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.16,
      "end_seconds": 281.57,
      "duration_seconds": 13.41,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's haemorrhoids, and we'll know more once the a blood count is back. I think a blood count makes sense here, for rectal bleeding"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 284.3,
      "end_seconds": 287.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "the earliest is Friday, 3:30 pm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.3,
      "end_seconds": 290.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Friday, that works for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.2,
      "end_seconds": 303.03,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "I'm going to put you on lactulose, 15 ml, twice a day, four weeks. You take it by mouth. That should help with constipation."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.81,
      "end_seconds": 305.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.4,
      "end_seconds": 318.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "Eat more fibre and drink water. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.96,
      "end_seconds": 321.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.29,
      "end_seconds": 325.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Come back in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.52,
      "end_seconds": 329.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.56,
      "end_seconds": 333.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.32,
      "end_seconds": 340.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
